     A* XDBPRFD - display file of WRKXDBPRF (program XDBPRFM):
     A* work with XDB connection profiles.
     A*
     A* Indicators  03 05 06 04 10 12  function keys
     A*             31-34  profile list     35-38  prompt list
     A*             71-74  option list      44 option kept for the next read
     A*             75-78  setup list       09 function key Setup
     A*             45 46 48  option in error
     A*             81-84  status of a setup line: in order, to do, failing,
     A*                    remark
     A*             40 key protected  41 all protected  47 keyword protected
     A*             51-65  field in error   90  message is an error
     A*
     A* Help: F1 is the Help key.  The help specifications (H) name the help
     A* modules of panel group WRKXDBPRF, which the system looks for through
     A* the library list: XDBPRFM puts its library there while it runs.  The
     A* module names are checked against the panel group by build/chk_help.py.
     A                                      DSPSIZ(24 80 *DS3)
     A                                      INDARA
     A                                      PRINT
     A                                      CA03(03 'Exit')
     A                                      CA12(12 'Cancel')
     A                                      HELP
     A                                      ALTHELP(CA01)
     A                                      HLPTITLE('XDBARDDRV profiles')
     A                                      HLPPNLGRP('XDB/GENERAL' WRKXDBPRF)
     A*
     A* List of profiles
     A          R SFL1                      SFL
     A  44                                  SFLNXTCHG
     A            S1OPT          1A  B  9  3
     A  45                                  DSPATR(RI PC)
     A            S1RDB         18A  O  9  7
     A            S1TYPE         6A  O  9 27
     A            S1HOST        26A  O  9 35
